  "worked_solution": "Since $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$, we can write $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-{c}_{1}+2{c}_{2} \\\\  & =2{c}_{2}-{c}_{1} \\\\  & =2{c}_{2}+(-{c}_{1}) \\\\  & =2{b}_{1}+{b}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$",
